  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Season the oxtail with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear the oxtail until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes per side.",
    "Transfer the oxtail to a plate and set aside.",
    "In the same pot, add the fish sauce, brown sugar, garlic, chili peppers, and coriander.",
    "Cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the lemon juice and cook for another minute.",
    "Place the oxtail back in the pot, then add the coconut milk, water, and Thai basil.",
    "Cover the pot with parchment paper and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Bake for 2 1/2 hours, or until the meat is tender and falls off the bone.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional Thai basil if desired."
  ],
